{"title": "Sapping Images", "pageid": 35197, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sapping_Images", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Ethereal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp/300px-Generic_Ethereal.webp, /w/images/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp/300px-Generic_Ethereal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Generic_Ethereal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Sapping Images</b> is an action used by <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a> that creates magical effigies that can siphon mental ability scores.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Creates <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\">magical effigies</a> that steal 2 points of Charisma, Intelligence, and Wisdom from nearby targets. \n</p>\nDestroying a mental effigy restores the ability points.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 6 m (20 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 6 m (20 ft) Radius</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/38px-Party_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/50px-Party_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Targets: All enemies in the radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Party_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Targets: All enemies in the radius</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_LOW_GithyankiProdigy_CullTheEvil</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_GithyankiProdigy_CullTheEvil\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_LOW_GithyankiProdigy_CullTheEvil\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Creature:_Ptaris.27_Mental_Image\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Ptaris'_Mental_Image\"> Creature: Ptaris' Mental Image </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Portrait_Ptaris%27_Mental_Image.png/120px-Portrait_Ptaris%27_Mental_Image.png.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Portrait_Ptaris%27_Mental_Image.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Portrait_Ptaris%27_Mental_Image.png/120px-Portrait_Ptaris%27_Mental_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Portrait_Ptaris%27_Mental_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>12</span></b></div> <span>(+1)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>12</span></b></div> <span>(+1)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>12</span></b></div> <span>(+1)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>2</span></b></div> <span>(-4)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>2</span></b></div> <span>(-4)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">CHA</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>2</span></b>\n<b></b></div><b> <span>(-4)</span></b>\n</td>\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>26</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>12</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<p>One image is created adjacent to each target in the area of effect. Each image applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Drain_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Drain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Drain_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Drain (Condition)\">Psionic Drain</a> to their respective targets until defeated. They have the following actions:\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Step\" title=\"Astral Step\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/60px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/80px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Step\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp/40px-Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Misty_Step_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Step\" title=\"Astral Step\">Astral Step</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Surrounded by silver mist, you teleport to an unoccupied space you can see. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sapping_Strike\" title=\"Sapping Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sapping Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sapping_Strike\" title=\"Sapping Strike\">Sapping Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Strike a foe and create a magical effigy that steal 2 points of <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> from the target.\n\nDestroying a mental effigy restores the ability points. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Psionic_Drain\"> Condition: Psionic Drain </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Drain_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Drain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Drain_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Drain (Condition)\">Psionic Drain</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Your Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities\" title=\"Abilities\">scores</a> are reduced by 2 while Ptaris drains your mind to form a Mental Image. If any ability score reaches 0, you die. Destroying the Mental Image releases the psionic energy and ends this effect.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715052141\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3706/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 72786/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 27235/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1524719/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n140.63%  120.281     39 Template:Trim\n100.00%   85.532      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   85.532      1 -total\n 15.12%   12.935      1 Template:Creature\n 14.67%   12.549      8 Template:Icon_text\n 14.45%   12.357      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.72%   10.878      2 Template:Spell_action\n 11.81%   10.104      1 Template:Creature/format\n 11.24%    9.614      1 Template:AttributeBlock\n 10.10%    8.639      3 Template:Resource\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35197-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715052141 and revision id 314654. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}